# node_modules is a mounted volume (see workload.go), never project source.
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
.vercel/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
# Secrets never enter history — /creds is outside the work tree already, but
# agents write .env files into the project when asked to configure things.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Local editor and operating-system files.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
# Platform markers and harness internals — not the user's source. (The bridge's
# file routes hide every dotfile, these included.)
# .claude/ and .mcp.json are deliberately NOT listed: they carry the Tatum skills
# and the docs MCP server so an export keeps working in an external agent.
.scaffolded
.opencode/
.vercel
